text: ['({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', 'Artifact spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice an artifact.\\nShrapnel Blast deals 5 damage to any target.', "Cast this spell only if you've cast another green spell this turn.\\nTrample", 'Cycling {2}{G} ({2}{G}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nWhen you cycle Krosan Tusker, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle. (Do this before you draw.)', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Draw two cards. If you control no artifacts, discard a card.', "Equipped creature gets +1/+2.\\nWhenever an Artificer enters the battlefield under your control, you may attach Inventor's Goggles to it.\\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)", 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nYou may cast green creature spells as though they had flash.', "Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if you control no Thopters other than Thopter Assembly, return Thopter Assembly to its owner's hand and create five 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature tokens with flying.", 'Flying\\nWhen Faerie Mechanist enters the battlefield, look at the top three cards of your library. You may reveal an artifact card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Galvanic Blast deals 2 damage to any target.\\nMetalcraft — Galvanic Blast deals 4 damage instead if you control three or more artifacts.', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\\nWhen Reclusive Artificer enters the battlefield, you may have it deal damage to target creature equal to the number of artifacts you control.', "Improvise (Your artifacts can help cast this spell. Each artifact you tap after you're done activating mana abilities pays for {1}.)\\nWhen Maverick Thopterist enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature tokens with flying.", 'Indestructible\\nEquipped creature has indestructible.\\nEquip {2}', 'Indestructible\\n{T}: Add {C}.', "Jagged-Scar Archers's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Elves you control.\\n{T}: Jagged-Scar Archers deals damage equal to its power to target creature with flying.", 'Look at the top five cards of your library. You may reveal any number of creature cards from among them and put the revealed cards into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Oran-Rief, the Vastwood enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G}.\\n{T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on each green creature that entered the battlefield this turn.', 'Other Elf creatures you control get +1/+1.\\n{T}: Add {G} for each Elf you control.', "Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\\nWhenever Ezuri's Archers blocks a creature with flying, Ezuri's Archers gets +3/+0 until end of turn.", 'Reach\\nOther Elf creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nWhenever Dwynen, Gilt-Leaf Daen attacks, you gain 1 life for each attacking Elf you control.', "Scuttling Doom Engine can't be blocked by creatures with power 2 or less.\\nWhen Scuttling Doom Engine dies, it deals 6 damage to target opponent or planeswalker.", 'Support 2. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures.)\\nChoose up to one target creature an opponent controls. Each creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it deals damage equal to its power to that creature.', 'Swiftwater Cliffs enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Swiftwater Cliffs enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {R}.', "Target creature you control gains vigilance and trample until end of turn. It deals damage equal to its power to target creature you don't control.", 'Temple of Epiphany enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Temple of Epiphany enters the battlefield, scry 1.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {R}.', 'Tranquil Thicket enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G}.\\nCycling {G} ({G}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Treetop Village enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G}.\\n{1}{G}: Treetop Village becomes a 3/3 green Ape creature with trample until end of turn. It's still a land. (It can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", 'Vigilance\\nAs long as you control six or more lands, Sylvan Advocate and land creatures you control get +2/+2.', 'Welding Sparks deals X damage to target creature, where X is 3 plus the number of artifacts you control.', "When Dwynen's Elite enters the battlefield, if you control another Elf, create a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token.", 'When Fierce Empath enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a creature card with mana value 6 or greater, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Filigree Familiar enters the battlefield, you gain 2 life.\\nWhen Filigree Familiar dies, draw a card.', "When Ghirapur Gearcrafter enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying. (A creature with flying can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", 'When Gladehart Cavalry enters the battlefield, support 6. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to six other target creatures.)\\nWhenever a creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it dies, you gain 2 life.', 'When Ichor Wellspring enters the battlefield or is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, draw a card.', 'When Kujar Seedsculptor enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control.', "When Llanowar Empath enters the battlefield, scry 2, then reveal the top card of your library. If it's a creature card, put it into your hand. (To scry 2, look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)", 'When Mycosynth Wellspring enters the battlefield or is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', "When Myr Battlesphere enters the battlefield, create four 1/1 colorless Myr artifact creature tokens.\\nWhenever Myr Battlesphere attacks, you may tap X untapped Myr you control. If you do, Myr Battlesphere gets +X/+0 until end of turn and deals X damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.", 'When Myr Sire dies, create a 1/1 colorless Phyrexian Myr artifact creature token.', 'When Pia and Kiran Nalaar enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature tokens with flying.\\n{2}{R}, Sacrifice an artifact: Pia and Kiran Nalaar deals 2 damage to any target.', 'When Regal Force enters the battlefield, draw a card for each green creature you control.', 'When Solemn Simulacrum enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.\\nWhen Solemn Simulacrum dies, you may draw a card.', 'When Treasure Mage enters the battlefield, you may search your library for an artifact card with mana value 6 or greater, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Trinket Mage enters the battlefield, you may search your library for an artifact card with mana value 1 or less, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Trophy Mage enters the battlefield, you may search your library for an artifact card with mana value 3, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Viridian Shaman enters the battlefield, destroy target artifact.', "When Whirler Rogue enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature tokens with flying.\\nTap two untapped artifacts you control: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", 'Whenever another Elf enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on Elvish Vanguard.', 'Whenever another green creature enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'Whenever you cast an artifact spell, you may draw a card. If you do, discard a card.', "{1}{U}, Sacrifice Neurok Replica: Return target creature to its owner's hand.", "{2}, Sacrifice Voyager Staff: Exile target creature. Return the exiled card to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.", '{8}: Target creature gets +5/+5 and gains trample until end of turn.', '{G}: Regenerate another target Elf.\\n{2}{G}{G}{G}: Elf creatures you control get +3/+3 and gain trample until end of turn.', '{R}, Sacrifice Pyrite Spellbomb: It deals 2 damage to any target.\\n{1}, Sacrifice Pyrite Spellbomb: Draw a card.', '{T}, Sacrifice an artifact: Barrage Ogre deals 2 damage to any target.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifice an artifact: You gain 1 life.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifice Foundry of the Consuls: Create two 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature tokens with flying.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {R}. Shivan Reef deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {G}.', '{T}: Add {G}{G}{G}.\\nForestcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Forest card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', '{T}: Add {R}.', '{T}: Add {U}.', "{T}: Choose target artifact a player controls and target artifact card in that player's graveyard. If both targets are still legal as this ability resolves, that player simultaneously sacrifices the artifact and returns the artifact card to the battlefield.", '{T}: Until end of turn, target Forest becomes an X/X Treefolk creature in addition to its other types, where X is the number of Elves you control.']
flavor: ['"How do the vinebred feel? Fah! We do not ask the puppet how it feels when the puppeteer bids it dance."', '"I can call an army to my side in the blink of an eye. Best not blink."', '"If there can be no victory, then I will fight forever."\\n—Koth of the Hammer', '"It\'s the must-have gift for everyone on your list. Get one for yourself, too!"\\n—Chammi, curio vendor', '"Life as we know it dangles on the brink of extinction. We must show the strength they would steal from us."\\n—*The Invokers\' Tales*', '"Life grows everywhere. My kin merely find those places where it grows strongest."\\n—Nissa Revane', '"Melt that which was never frozen."\\n—Spellbomb inscription', '"Our glorious infection has taken hold."\\n—Elesh Norn, Grand Cenobite', '"Our lives are woven together like the trees\' branches over our heads, forming a canopy that protects us all."', '"Skyknight gear? Well, I have drake-skin gauntlets, supple and fireproof. Or a ceratok chestplate that\'ll stop a crossbow bolt."', '"So even the heart of our world has succumbed."\\n—Koth of the Hammer', '"The elves tend the forest, and the forest sustains the elves. My role is to ensure that the cycle continues."', '"The fires of invention burn in all of us. I fight for the freedom to unleash those flames."\\n—Pia Nalaar', '"The land gives of itself. Its abundance provides, even in times of chaos."', '"The tools of the past will help us forge the future."', '"This is our land. We will not allow eyeblights to poison its beauty."', 'A masterwork of spite, inspired by madness.', 'All around the foundry, automatons unhitched themselves from their mounts and pivoted to face Chandra.', 'All the curiosity of the Neurok with only a trace of their duplicity.', 'Call one, call them all.', 'Eidren, perfect of Lys Alana, ordered hundreds of trees uprooted and rearranged into a pattern he deemed beautiful. Thus the Gilt-Leaf Wood was born.', 'Every leaf, tree, and building in Kujar has been placed to achieve maximum harmony, in accordance with the elvish philosophy known as the Great Conduit.', 'Eyes and arrows trained ever skyward.', 'For the Phyrexians, death is not an end, nor a one-time occurrence.', 'From trinket to trauma.', "Great hero or grand betrayer? The truth of Ezuri's legacy is clouded by the fog of legend.", 'It rarely moves, standing stock still in its clearing. When it does stir, ravens stop their cawing and crickets their chirping. All of nature watches in awed silence.', "It's wise not to disturb an artist at work.", 'Kuldotha, wellspring of molten metal, temple of the goblin horde.', 'Lumengrid, site of the Knowledge Pool, source of vedalken arcana.', 'Many elves incorporate the beauty of nature into their inventions. Very few capture its savagery.', 'She stands as a living symbol of the natural world and an enemy of the forces that threaten it.', 'Structures built from darksteel yield to neither assault nor age.', 'The Neurok see the artificer as an archaeologist, clearing away falsehoods to see the truth hidden beneath.', 'The artificers of Kaladesh strive ceaselessly for perfection, progress, and the ultimate expression of elegance.', "The elves had devised countless strategies to combat Memnarch's war machines, but they had no idea what to do when one was *thrown* at them.", 'The greatest masters of the craft abandon tools altogether, shaping metal with hand and mind alone.', 'The metal must be pure. The hand must be steady. The product must be perfect.', 'The oil created the mycosynth. The mycosynth created New Phyrexia.', 'The remains of ancient civilizations litter the run-down land.', 'The safewright Talara protects a delicate woodland waterfall. She has vowed to send wave after wave of warriors to slay any who would dare disturb its beauty.', 'Voyager staffs are sought by those hoping to find an escape from the sprawling glut of Ravnica.']
artist: ['Anna Steinbauer', 'Brandon Kitkouski', 'Cynthia Sheppard', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'David Rapoza', 'Efrem Palacios', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Erica Yang', 'Eytan Zana', 'Filip Burburan', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'Heather Hudson', 'Hideaki Takamura', 'Izzy', 'Jaime Jones', 'James Paick', 'Jason Felix', 'Jim Nelson', 'Johann Bodin', 'Johannes Voss', 'John Avon', 'Jung Park', 'Kev Walker', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Marc Simonetti', 'Mark Tedin', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Mike Bierek', 'Paolo Parente', 'Quinton Hoover', 'Ralph Horsley', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Rob Alexander', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Sam Burley', 'Scott Chou', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Shelly Wan', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Tomasz Jedruszek', 'Tsutomu Kawade', 'Tyler Jacobson', 'Victor Adame Minguez', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Warren Mahy', 'Wesley Burt', 'Winona Nelson', 'Yeong-Hao Han', 'Zack Stella', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai']
